# Exclude everything except the inputs required to build the web workspace.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!package.json
!yarn.lock
!docs/
!docs/package.json
!web/
!web/**

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.log
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
web/vitest.config.mjs
